  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-5885\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/bh_jof_title.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1434\" height=\"427\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p>\n<a href=\"https://kreezcraft.com/jump_over_fences_forge\"><img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-5886\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/bh_jof_bisect.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1429\" height=\"229\" /></a>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">若您希望零門檻為任何整合包架設伺服器，可透過 <a href=\"https://kreezcraft.com/jump_over_fences_forge\">BisectHosting 取得伺服器主機</a>，新用戶首月使用優惠碼 kreezxil 即可享有 25% 折扣。</p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-5887\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/bh_jof_overview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1434\" height=\"149\" />此為基於 MIT 授權，將 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/therealp455w0rd\">TheRealp455w0rd</a> 開發的 https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fence-jumper 移植至 1.16.4+ 版本的作品。\n\n&nbsp;\n\n當牆壁與柵欄阻擋去路時別煩惱，現在你可以直接跳過去！\n\n&nbsp;\n\n此模組僅需安裝於客戶端（Client）。\n&nbsp;\n自 1.13.1 版本起，此模組會向伺服器發送存在訊號。\n\n&nbsp;\n\n無需申請權限，直接安裝即可。\n\n<img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-5888\" src=\"https://kreezcraft.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/bh_jof_community.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1434\" height=\"149\" />\n\n&nbsp;\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ngNQjT5\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/96753964485181440/widget.png?style=banner2\" /></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/kreezxil\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://s12.directupload.net/images/200916/joj33k55.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/MinecraftModdedForge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://s12.directupload.net/images/200916/efhmdjhg.png\" /></a></p>",
